      {
        "label": "1st period",
        "score": "BOS 1, CAR 1",
        "text": "Boston struck on the power play 1:31 in: David Pastrnak fed Elias Lindholm from behind the net, and Lindholm found Pavel Zacha on the doorstep for a 1–0 lead. Tanner Jeannot fought Nicolas Deslauriers at 13:55. With 52 seconds left, Nikolaj Ehlers stripped the puck on the forecheck and Jackson Blake tied it 1–1."
      },
      {
        "label": "2nd period",
        "score": "BOS 1, CAR 1",
        "text": "No goals, but Carolina tilted the ice. Nikita Zadorov and Hampus Lindholm took tripping minors late in the period, and Boston went 20:39 without a shot from late in the second into the third."
      },
      {
        "label": "3rd period",
        "score": "Final: CAR 2, BOS 1",
        "text": "The Bruins killed a 5-on-3 to open the period, and Matthew Poitras rang a backhand off the iron with an open net. At 10:19, Sebastian Aho finished a rush set up by Andrei Svechnikov and William Carrier for a 2–1 lead. Carolina then killed two Boston power plays in the final five minutes."
      }
    ],
